</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

'''Note:''' Warmly faction required.

===No Faction Hit Option===
Talk to [[Commander Kane]] at the Shrine of Bertoxxulus in [[Qeynos Aqueducts]] and he will ask you to deliver [[Blackburrow Stout]] '''(NO DROP version)''' to [[Barn Bloodstone]] who is located outside the Golden Rooster in [[Highpass]].  If [[Commander Kane]] doesn't talk to you at first, just Hail him and say, "The disease is spreading."  Your faction with [[Barn Bloodstone|Barn]] needs to be at least indifferent.  To raise it you can do the [[Note for Janam]] and/or [[Note for Rebby]] quests in the [[East Freeport]]. 

===Faction Hit Option===
If you don't care about faction you can kill [[Mutt Rootlit]], who stands next to [[Barn Bloodstone]], and she will drop the [[Bayle List I]]. 
Doing this will give a serious faction hit for 

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[The Freeport Militia]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Corrupt Qeynos Guards]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Carson McCabe]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Coalition of Tradefolk]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Coalition of TradeFolk III]] got worse.
</div>

